  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the Agentic Commerce Protocol (ACP) at API version 2026-04-17, pinned to repository commit 7fdd78d: Agentic Checkout sessions (create, update, retrieve, complete, cancel, status, line items, fulfillment, totals, messages, capability negotiation, payment handlers, 3DS), Delegate Payment vault tokens with one-time allowances, order webhooks signed with Merchant-Signature, the flat error model, mandatory idempotency, API-Version negotiation, request signing headers, discovery and the MCP binding. Agentic Checkout and Delegate Payment share one date-based version, so there is one line: 2026-04-17 is current, 2026-01-30, 2026-01-16, 2025-12-12 and 2025-09-29 are legacy with upgrade checklists, and spec/unreleased is tracked as a preview. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, checkout, delegate payment, security and headers, and webhooks and errors.",
